[71.049152, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ parses a signature header with two v1 entries \u001b[90m(1.087697ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ accepts a correctly signed body \u001b[90m(0.780883ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[71.050232, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ rejects a body signed with the wrong secret \u001b[90m(0.410554ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a stale timestamp \u001b[90m(0.287203ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ policy: small INR refunds auto-approve, others go to review \u001b[90m(0.119296ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelling a pending refund \u001b[90m(2.519967ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ a redelivered event creates only one refund \u001b[90m(0.704751ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ authz: keys map to role permissions \u001b[90m(0.997821ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[71.063701, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ a Paygate replay of an older delivery is accepted once (docs/SPEC.md, Replays) \u001b[90m(28.730419ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
